(#$ist #$CoreCycLMt (#$comment #$completeExtentDecidableForValueInArg "(#$completeExtentDecidableForValueInArg PRED VALUE ARGNUM) means that when the #$CycInferenceEngine is asked a closed query of the form (PRED ... VALUE ...) where VALUE appears in the ARGNUMth position, either it can prove (PRED ... VALUE ...) without transformation, or (#$not (PRED ... VALUE ...)) is true."))
